WEBVTT

00:00:06.347 --> 00:00:13.069
On your company's page, select Historical Data

00:00:13.069 --> 00:00:18.521
If an ad box covers the page, close it with the X in its corner

00:00:18.521 --> 00:00:24.306
Each row is one trading day, newest at the top

00:00:24.306 --> 00:00:30.900
Use the Close column (not Adj Close) and the Volume column

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:35.955
Scroll down to the day of the report

00:00:35.955 --> 00:00:41.115
Airbnb reported after the close on Nov 5, so Nov 6 is the reaction day, with the largest Volume

00:00:41.115 --> 00:00:51.666
Copy the Close for Before (the row below the reaction day), the reaction day and five rows above it

00:00:51.666 --> 00:01:10.000
Open the S&P 500's history and copy its Close for the same three dates
